{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/7ef3084dd57feacbd29cb3d935bf8b8a.poster.avif?t=1756292474\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/7ef3084dd57feacbd29cb3d935bf8b8a.webm?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/7ef3084dd57feacbd29cb3d935bf8b8a.mp4?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Embark on an adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ta-Miu is a narrative action-adventure set in ancient Egypt, filled with exploration, environmental puzzles, and platforming challenges. Play as the cat Ta-Miu, save the Pharaoh from the god Seth, and restore balance between the world of humans and the gods!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>A magical world of the living and the dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the boundary between the realm of mortals and the land of spirits. The eastern bank of the Nile is a bustling city of the living, while the western side belongs to the dead and supernatural forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/510ea13ab22889ef1a0ab3726f0e5d96.poster.avif?t=1756292474\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/510ea13ab22889ef1a0ab3726f0e5d96.webm?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/510ea13ab22889ef1a0ab3726f0e5d96.mp4?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08\u00a0<strong>A heroine with claws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse ruins and palaces as a nimble cat. Climb, balance, and solve environmental puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<strong>Mythology in practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is inspired by a different deity and their powers. Meet Bastet, Thoth, Isis, Horus, Osiris, and more \u2013 earning their blessings to unlock unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.poster.avif?t=1756292474\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.webm?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.mp4?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d\u00a0<strong>Companions and bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend Sahi, a loyal mummy companion from the land of the dead, and visit the enigmatic merchant cat to play rounds of the ancient Egyptian game Senet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0<strong>Style and authenticity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a passion for Egyptian mythology and culture, Ta-Miu was designed and created by an archaeologist-egyptologist. The game combines magic and reflection with authentic cultural inspirations \u2013 free of violence, but full of wonder and respect for the history and myths of ancient Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.poster.avif?t=1756292474\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.webm?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.mp4?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825470?t=1756292474","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/24e5db46fb2cbeb0affd939b0a626d2a45a65346/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756292474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/661c52a2eccf524f1c66e0737cad23708bb7312b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756292474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/661c52a2eccf524f1c66e0737cad23708bb7312b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756292474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/e