laces as a nimble cat. Climb, balance, and solve environmental puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<strong>Mythology in practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is inspired by a different deity and their powers. Meet Bastet, Thoth, Isis, Horus, Osiris, and more \u2013 earning their blessings to unlock unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.poster.avif?t=1756292474\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.webm?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/b3c4c20b482f6fd911bab9ba2e4f4f54.mp4?t=1756292474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d\u00a0<strong>Companions and bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend Sahi, a loyal mummy companion from the land of the dead, and visit the enigmatic merchant cat to play rounds of the ancient Egyptian game Senet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0<strong>Style and authenticity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a passion for Egyptian mythology and culture, Ta-Miu was designed and created by an archaeologist-egyptologist. The game combines magic and reflection with authentic cultural inspirations \u2013 free of violence, but full of wonder and respect for the history and myths of ancient Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i